# Scoped to the CI stamp inputs, nothing else. build/stamp.sh digests the
# lib/dcimgui/ sources and the build scripts to decide whether lib/prebuilt/ is
# stale: those bytes must be identical on every checkout, on every OS, whatever
# the user's core.autocrlf, otherwise the digest flaps and the windows artifact
# would be seen as stale on every single push.
#
# Everything else in the repo keeps git's default behavior. Note that lib/imgui
# and lib/dear_bindings are submodules, i.e. separate repositories with their
# own .gitattributes: nothing here applies to them.
/build/** -text
/lib/dcimgui/** -text

# Committed build artifacts: never treat as text, and never try to auto-merge
# them (a merged binary is a corrupt binary, so surface the conflict instead).
/lib/prebuilt/** binary -diff -merge
